        "Content": "⭐ Quality 4-bedroom property with 2 en-suite bedrooms\r\n⭐ Gort allows Easy access to M18 motorway and just a short commute to Galway City, Ennis, Shannon\r\n⭐ Mature landscaped Gardens – not overlooked front or rear – \r\n⭐ Total area is 278 sqm (2,992 sq. ft.)\r\n⭐ Heated by an oil-fired central heating system and open fires\r\n⭐ Property located on the fringe of the town Gort, which includes many independent retail shops, businesses, schools, post office, garda and fire station and train and bus services\r\n⭐ C 2 Energy rating\r\n⭐ Quality fitted kitchen with granite worktops"
